                            <comment id="16578241" author="astelmak" created="Mon, 13 Aug 2018 12:54:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good for me  &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://ggsystems.atlassian.net/images/icons/emoticons/wink.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16579610" author="jokser" created="Tue, 14 Aug 2018 10:22:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt; I&apos;ve merged last master and re-run TC. Could you please look again?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16585983" author="ascherbakov" created="Mon, 20 Aug 2018 14:10:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Jokser&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jokser&quot;&gt;Jokser&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have concerns about your solution. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. Currently a node is failed only in case of InvalidEnvironmentException which is StorageException or CorruptedTreeException. But it doesn&apos;t cover all possible reasons of heuristic exceptions. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should treat IgniteTxHeuristicCheckedException as Error and fail node for every occurence of such exception.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. IgniteTxLocalAdapter.userCommit has tx printing methods which could fail for many reasons: OOM for large tx, metadata corruption, etc.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s necessary to escape them using utility method CU.txString(tx) like it&apos;s already done for remote txs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;IgniteCheckedException err = new IgniteTxHeuristicCheckedException(&quot;Failed to locally write to cache &quot; +
                            &quot;(all transaction entries will be invalidated, however there was a window when &quot; +
                            &quot;entries for this transaction were visible to others): &quot; + *this*, ex);

                        if (isNodeStopping) {
                            U.warn(log, &quot;Failed to commit transaction, node is stopping [tx=&quot; + *this* +
                                &quot;, err=&quot; + ex + &apos;]&apos;);
                        }
                        else if (hasInvalidEnvironmentIssue) {
                            U.warn(log, &quot;Failed to commit transaction, node is in invalid state and will be stopped [tx=&quot; + *this* +
                                &quot;, err=&quot; + ex + &apos;]&apos;);
                        }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. Please update to current master. Where are some changes related to node failing on tx commit failure which probably should be modified with regard to p.1&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16587585" author="agoncharuk" created="Tue, 21 Aug 2018 15:23:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me given that TC passes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16587586" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 21 Aug 2018 15:24:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC is running, I will re-check it later and merge (provided there are no concerns from other reviewers).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16587589" author="jokser" created="Tue, 21 Aug 2018 15:25:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ascherbakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ascherbakov&quot;&gt;ascherbakov&lt;/a&gt; I think, your concerns 1 and 2 can be fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9082&quot; title=&quot;Throwing checked exception during tx commit without node stopping leads to data corruption&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9082&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9082&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ticket. Master has updated.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
